1
00:00:04,233 --> 00:00:05,100
Mind the steps

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,300
Thanks

3
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:09,166
No need to be so polite now

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,300
What should I say then

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,500
Mrs Fu

6
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:13,466
Regretting it

7
00:00:14,166 --> 00:00:17,466
No I just suddenly felt that Mrs Fu

8
00:00:17,466 --> 00:00:19,366
Has a nice ring to it

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,300
We already got our marriage certificate

10
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,866
I need to make some things clear upfront

11
00:00:21,866 --> 00:00:22,433
Right now I don't have

12
00:00:22,433 --> 00:00:23,500
Gu Chuze's family background

13
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,666
Or a grand wedding like that

14
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:25,466
I don't need it

15
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:27,400
I saw enough of grand weddings just now

16
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,166
It was lively indeed

17
00:00:28,166 --> 00:00:29,833
But no one actually asked if I wanted it

18
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:30,833
Then what is this for

19
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:32,233
To start over

20
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,366
And to never give myself

21
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:34,566
To someone unworthy again

22
00:00:34,966 --> 00:00:35,353
Where to stay

23
00:00:35,353 --> 00:00:36,304
You can't go back to the Su family

24
00:00:36,304 --> 00:00:36,833
in a wedding dress

25
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:38,066
You'll easily get ambushed at a hotel

26
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,833
I walked out with too much swagger

27
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:40,766
That I forgot to change

28
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,000
I have a small but quiet place

29
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:43,933
Then I'll trouble Mr Fu

30
00:00:43,933 --> 00:00:44,833
to take me in for a night

31
00:00:44,866 --> 00:00:45,400
A night

32
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,100
The first night of our marriage

33
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,100
Let's count it as one night for now

34
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,466
Alright Mrs Fu calls the shots

35
00:00:54,466 --> 00:00:55,266
What are you looking at

36
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,548
The onlookers are busier than

37
00:00:57,548 --> 00:00:58,600
those at the wedding

38
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,000
So harsh
